# wgpu-hal 30.0.1: Kandelo takes the native EGL path, with libEGL and
# libwayland-egl linked at build time (no dlopen, as on Emscripten), and
# the GLES limits of WebGL2, which renders its GL: no 16-byte-unaligned
# buffer bindings, no unrestricted index buffers, no index role change.
